      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpegha pipö Israel surkwen pö Sin lenyini kimwochï ECHOTYON akïmang Repidim. Wölo kimömicha pögh cho kigheghöy chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsyal nko Musa akïlenchï, “Konecha pögh keghegha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Musa, “Ompö ne tongwïrngwïronchanïkwa? Akwompö ne totyömekwa ECHOTYON?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyam pich maral ompö atoni. Kïngwïrngwïronchï Musa akïlö, “Ompö ne temïtunenechanyi Misri ateparecha nko monecha nko kyakicha ompö maral?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrirchï Musa ECHOTYON lö, “Oghan ne ompö pïchï? Kamach kïwirenanïn koghïn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, “Wïyö tawu pich aiwö nko poyi Israel ainamata lïkïyay kilïwenyi lalwa Nile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oghyongenan tawungu ompö ghatya Sinay atolapay Ilïw ghatye, pkono nyu pögh cho gheghöy pich.” Kwigh Musa lenyoni ompö tawu poyi Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkurö atoni Masa nko Meripa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Masa nko Meripa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ompö Eprania kï, ngwïrngwïronöt nko tyamat.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ompöwölo kingwïrngwïronchö pipö Israel akïtyam ECHOTYON lö, “Ekïmito ECHOTYON nko acha nya anta ewo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Poryot nko pipö Amalek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kupokyï pipö Amalek pipö Israel ompö Repidim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Musa Yoswö, “Kïla mïrön cho pö okuntönyo kïpa kïporyeghö pipö Amalek. Oghyongenan asïyech kutïng parak nko lïpö Tororöt nyo mi ewunechan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïporyeghö Yoswö pipö Amalek lenyini kimwochï Musa, kïwö Musa nko Aron nko Ur kutang kutïng parak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtenö otini kisyol Musa ewunechi parak, kïrïnta pipö Israel, wölo nyini kerekunö ewunechi, kïrïnta pipö Amalek pipö Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kyoghochö mori Musa, kïcheng chane kagh akutö nyinte kïtöpö. Kïtigh Aron nko Ur ewunechi, anka ewu tagh anka ewu löt, atökïghïtö ewunechi ntökïröytö asis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrïnta Yoswö pipö lïk cho pö pipö Amalek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
